Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: carry forward the guarded liuqin SLPI node

Carry forward the device-tree change from the tested 2026-11-17 boot.
Boot arguments must keep qcom_q6v5_pas.slpi_auto_boot=0. The persistent
firmware hash guard and matching old firmware are separate prerequisites.
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8475-xiaomi-liuqin.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8475-xiaomi-liuqin.dts
@@ -1477,7 +1477,7 @@
 
 &remoteproc_slpi {
 	firmware-name = "qcom/sm8475/liuqin/slpi.mbn";
-	status = "disabled";
+	status = "okay";
 };
 
 /*
